<code>[theme]
name = "quiet"</code></pre><h2>Publishing</h2><p>Automatic, once a build has made a deploy.</p><h2>Credentials</h2><section class="look-empty"><h2>No credentials</h2><p>A public source needs none. A private git repository needs a token: add one with `ink source add --token`.</p></section></main></div></body></html>
